{"type":"message","id":"25089166","parentId":"38259772","timestamp":"2026-03-03T11:47:41.020Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Tue 2026-03-03 19:47 GMT+8] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/2). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: # cgnsMeshCutter 项目 - 阶段二：引入 compi & cgio\n\n## 项目信息\n- **工作目录:** `/home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter`\n- **技术栈:** CMake + G++ (C++17)\n- **测试文件:** `build/pipe.yaml` + `build/pipe.cgns`\n\n## 重要：MPI 环境配置\n\n**MPI 已安装在:** `/home/one/app/petsc-3.14.0`\n\n**编译前必须执行:**\n```bash\ncd /home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter/build\nsource ../env.sh\nexport PATH=$MPI_ROOT/bin:$PATH\nexport LD_LIBRARY_PATH=$MPI_ROOT/lib:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH\n```\n\n**如果 CMake 找不到 MPI，使用:**\n```bash\ncmake .. -DMPI_C_COMPILER=/home/one/app/petsc-3.14.0/bin/mpicc \\\n         -DMPI_CXX_COMPILER=/home/one/app/petsc-3.14.0/bin/mpicxx\n```\n\n## 阶段二任务\n\n### 1. 集成 compi (MPI 封装)\n**位置:** `/home/one/projects/compi`\n**替换:** `src/mpiAdapter.h/cpp`\n\n### 2. 集成 cgio (CGNS IO 封装)\n**位置:** `/home/one/projects/cgio`\n**替换:** `src/cgFile.h/cpp`\n\n### 3. 更新 CMakeLists.txt\n- 设置 C++17 标准\n- 添加 compi/cgio 依赖\n- 配置 MPI 路径\n\n### 4. 删除旧代码\n- 删除 `src/mpiAdapter.h/cpp`\n- 删除 `src/cgFile.h/cpp`\n\n## 验收标准\n\n```bash\ncd /home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter/build\nsource ../env.sh\nexport PATH=$MPI_ROOT/bin:$PATH\n\ncmake .. && make -j\n\n# Metis 验证（串行运行 cutter）\n./cutter.exe -m pipe.cgns -np 2\nmpirun -n 2 /home/one/app/act/incomACT.exe -c pipe.yaml\n```\n\n**通过标准:** 编译成功，CFD 计算收敛\n\n## 团队协作\n\nspawn 子 agent 时**必须**包含 Workspace:\n```markdown\n## Task: <任务名>\n## Workspace: /home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter\n## Context: <背景>\n## Requirements: <需求>\n## Deliverable: <交付物>\n```"}],"timestamp":1772538461017}}
